{"3902590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sweet Dreams Café", "steam_appid": 3902590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/021d8e3cbfc5abaf503aa86050e3c363.avif?t=1759152442\" width=1600 height=589 /></span><i>Sweet Dreams Café</i> is a polished, premium experience with 3 full chapters and over 400 levels already playable. We’re launching in Early Access to understand the appetite for casual puzzle games on Steam and invite players to help shape the final chapter of Amira’s story. Your feedback will guide how we move forward toward full release.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧁 <strong>Premium Puzzle Gameplay</strong><br>No microtransactions. No energy timers. Just a beautifully balanced, pay-once experience designed for puzzle lovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍰 <strong>Match Cakes &amp; Solve Challenges</strong><br>Match pastries to complete hundreds of handcrafted levels. Use boosters  to overcome tricky puzzles and earn coins to renovate your café.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/69d3480019e82b9a7edbe276b77b02b4.poster.avif?t=1759152442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/69d3480019e82b9a7edbe276b77b02b4.webm?t=1759152442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/69d3480019e82b9a7edbe276b77b02b4.mp4?t=1759152442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏡 <strong>Renovate Your Pâtisserie</strong><br>Restore and decorate the bakery, patio, garden, and shopfront. Unlock new spaces and create a warm, inviting place for a diverse cast of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/3b1d1827e0d8f11a2a866c22383f9ee5.poster.avif?t=1759152442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/3b1d1827e0d8f11a2a866c22383f9ee5.webm?t=1759152442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/3b1d1827e0d8f11a2a866c22383f9ee5.mp4?t=1759152442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 <strong>Shape the Story</strong><br>Help Amira become part of her new community. Discover new relationships, explore personal growth, and maybe even find love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/fe5e8a65c8351c16c236933e20a9306d.poster.avif?t=1759152442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/fe5e8a65c8351c16c236933e20a9306d.webm?t=1759152442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902590/extras/fe5e8a65c8351c16c236933e20a9306d.mp4?t=1759152442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 <strong>Explore Paris</strong><br>Customize your café to fit into a chic Parisian neighborhood. Discover new streets, meet locals, and build a life full of dreams and pastries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=